  "goodToKnow": "Die Fahrerflucht (also Unfallflucht) is a hit-and-run; legally, unerlaubtes Entfernen vom Unfallort under §142 StGB. Even after a minor bump to a parked car, leaving just a note behind the windscreen wiper isn't enough: you must wait a reasonable time or inform the police. It can mean a fine, losing one's licence and penalty points. It has no plural."
